SOAPBOX: goals for the WPX test: 1,000 QSOs, 500 mults, and a million
SOAPBOX: points. I never came close to any of those until this weekend when
SOAPBOX: I hit all three for the first time even with all the fills needed
SOAPBOX: in both directions. No big deal for a lot of ops, but it made for
SOAPBOX: a good weekend here.
